  "description": "<p>Container acl:Append prohibits \"DELETE {} INSERT { ... }\" but allows \"DELETE DATA { ... }\"</p>\n\n<p>That is, it disallows a DELETE/INSERT statement with an empty DELETE clause, but does allow a DELETE DATA statement with a non-empty clause.</p>\n\n<p>This behavior should be reversed to allow DELETE/INSERT when the DELETE clause is empty, and prohibit DELETE DATA statements entirely.</p>",
